<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="765d8e75">Report mock-ups will not only provide an opportunity to validate the understanding of the underlying requirement with the
report users, but also help to identify various display parameters used in complex and multi-tab reporting.</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="f406595a"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="24425f38">&lt;p&gt;
    Report mock-ups often do not include real data for privacy and security reasons.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="98eb4419"></attribute>
<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="2517a304">To provide a prototype of final reports to stakeholders who can then provide feedback and request any structural
changes before actual development of the reports commence.</attribute>
